(4759782, 686523, 91753, '<td valign="top">Realllllly nice shot, love the background and the pose! <i>(and the hat)</i>  :P</td>', 'Realllllly nice shot, love the background and the pose! (and the hat)  :P', '2008-06-09 15:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759849, 685066, 94289, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot for this challenge.  Shadows and truly a cowboy''s end of the day.</td>', 'I think this is a great shot for this challenge.  Shadows and truly a cowboy''s end of the day.', '2008-06-09 16:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759900, 686921, 30049, '<td valign="top">A very nice product type shot.  Looks like a window display.  The boots look ready for the dance floor!  Hat too.  :-)  Overall, I like this...I just happen to like some of the more rustic horse/cowboy type shots better.  It''s a nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very nice product type shot.  Looks like a window display.  The boots look ready for the dance floor!  Hat too.  :-)  Overall, I like this...I just happen to like some of the more rustic horse/cowboy type shots better.  It''s a nice photo.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-06-09 16:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759901, 685996, 30049, '<td valign="top">:-)  It''s funny.  The first thing I thought of when this image loaded is a country music singer rather than a cowboy.  It''s a very well put together photo with a strong composition and lines.  Should do fine for you.  Good luck.</td>', ':-)  It''s funny.  The first thing I thought of when this image loaded is a country music singer rather than a cowboy.  It''s a very well put together photo with a strong composition and lines.  Should do fine for you.  Good luck.', '2008-06-09 17:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759905, 686780, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like it overall.  The burning is a bit heavy, obvious...the wood grain of the fence post could be more prominent (sharper) with just a touch more contrast.</td>', 'I like it overall.  The burning is a bit heavy, obvious...the wood grain of the fence post could be more prominent (sharper) with just a touch more contrast.', '2008-06-09 17:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759908, 687029, 30049, '<td valign="top">An ok photo of a cowboy hat.  A bit static.  Not sure what the item is in the back left?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'An ok photo of a cowboy hat.  A bit static.  Not sure what the item is in the back left?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-06-09 17:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759913, 686523, 30049, '<td valign="top">A nice portrait.  Seems overly staged and not as authentic as a couple others in the challenge, but still a nice entry overall.</td>', 'A nice portrait.  Seems overly staged and not as authentic as a couple others in the challenge, but still a nice entry overall.', '2008-06-09 17:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759917, 686309, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a decent equipment type image.  Seems like it could use just a bit more contrast.  The sepia is a good choice.</td>', 'This is a decent equipment type image.  Seems like it could use just a bit more contrast.  The sepia is a good choice.', '2008-06-09 17:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759920, 687022, 30049, '<td valign="top">A nice still life photo overall.  Good color.  I wish the light hadn''t fell off of the buckle so quickly.</td>', 'A nice still life photo overall.  Good color.  I wish the light hadn''t fell off of the buckle so quickly.', '2008-06-09 17:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759925, 686401, 30049, '<td valign="top">A nice capture of an elusive varmit in daylight hours.  By itself it''s a wonderful image that would fit in many challenges.  It fits this one, but a tad thinly IMO (very title dependent).  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A nice capture of an elusive varmit in daylight hours.  By itself it''s a wonderful image that would fit in many challenges.  It fits this one, but a tad thinly IMO (very title dependent).  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2008-06-09 17:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759929, 686901, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Lighting is a little hot on the horse and the focal plane is just falling off on the "cowboy''s" face (leaving him just a tad soft).  Great idea...timing (not midday with strong sunlight) could really make a difference on this.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Lighting is a little hot on the horse and the focal plane is just falling off on the "cowboy''s" face (leaving him just a tad soft).  Great idea...timing (not midday with strong sunlight) could really make a difference on this.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-06-09 17:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759963, 686873, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not sure how a woody will be received but oh well. <br/> <br/>That aside you have some blown highlights on woody''s arm which draw the eye away from everything else in the scene.</td>', 'Not sure how a woody will be received but oh well.  That aside you have some blown highlights on woody''s arm which draw the eye away from everything else in the scene.', '2008-06-09 17:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759970, 687030, 66494, '<td valign="top">Fantastic tribute. 10 in my books!</td>', 'Fantastic tribute. 10 in my books!', '2008-06-09 17:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759974, 685066, 84124, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one actually gave me chills.  I''ve never given a 10 on this site, but this may be the first.  Wow, very well done.  9 for now.</td>', 'Wow, this one actually gave me chills.  I''ve never given a 10 on this site, but this may be the first.  Wow, very well done.  9 for now.', '2008-06-09 17:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759982, 686476, 67258, '<td valign="top">A lovely idea and pleasingly photographed.  The creases in the cloth by the horses leg are a little distracting, and I would prefer a square crop, but aside from that I like it.</td>', 'A lovely idea and pleasingly photographed.  The creases in the cloth by the horses leg are a little distracting, and I would prefer a square crop, but aside from that I like it.', '2008-06-09 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759984, 686398, 66494, '<td valign="top">I think you''ve got a fantastic diagonal going on here and the lighting is magnificent.</td>', 'I think you''ve got a fantastic diagonal going on here and the lighting is magnificent.', '2008-06-09 17:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759986, 686325, 66494, '<td valign="top">Fantastic pose, model, and effect in general. Well done.</td>', 'Fantastic pose, model, and effect in general. Well done.', '2008-06-09 17:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759987, 687032, 66494, '<td valign="top">What a cutie. Love the bandana that emphasizes the beautiful blue eyes.</td>', 'What a cutie. Love the bandana that emphasizes the beautiful blue eyes.', '2008-06-09 17:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759988, 685996, 66494, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Love the diagonal.</td>', 'Great composition. Love the diagonal.', '2008-06-09 17:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759990, 686777, 66494, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2008-06-09 17:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759991, 686873, 66494, '<td valign="top">WELL DONE.</td>', 'WELL DONE.', '2008-06-09 17:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759993, 685774, 66494, '<td valign="top">Love that lighting. It truly does look like a heavenly spot.</td>', 'Love that lighting. It truly does look like a heavenly spot.', '2008-06-09 17:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4759995, 686805, 66494, '<td valign="top">Wow. And I like the diagonal that is formed here. That stare just keeps drawing me in.</td>', 'Wow. And I like the diagonal that is formed here. That stare just keeps drawing me in.', '2008-06-09 17:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
