(4760013, 686151, 36006, '<td valign="top">This is still a shoehorn, imo.<br/> <br/>I like this image however. I like most of what I see. Of course there is the matter of what I would of done in post compared to your final edit, but I still like it.<br/> <br/>The thing I don''t like about it is the title. It''s an obvious display of shoehorning an image with the use of the title to point the way.<br/> <br/>You only needed to convince me that this was in fact the Dallas Cowboys new home. I would of scored fairer.<br/> <br/>How? <br/> <br/>What about some sort of emblem, or icon, or sign, or something...anything that actually tells me that this <b><i>is</i></b> the new home for the Dallas Cowboys.<br/> <br/>But, all I have is your word, the title. <br/> <br/>This may in fact be the new home for the Dallas Cowboys,...or it may be something else for all I know. <br/> <br/>Your not letting me, a non fan of the Dallas Cowboys, have the choice loving, or hating the new home of the Dallas Cowboys because all it is is a building being built. It is lacking that one element to make this image fit the title, and make it even more special than it is.<br/> <br/>Never give up, try again.</td>', 'This is still a shoehorn, imo. I like this image however. I like most of what I see. Of course there is the matter of what I would of done in post compared to your final edit, but I still like it. The thing I don''t like about it is the title. It''s an obvious display of shoehorning an image with the use of the title to point the way. You only needed to convince me that this was in fact the Dallas Cowboys new home. I would of scored fairer. How?  What about some sort of emblem, or icon, or sign, or something...anything that actually tells me that this is the new home for the Dallas Cowboys. But, all I have is your word, the title.  This may in fact be the new home for the Dallas Cowboys,...or it may be something else for all I know.  Your not letting me, a non fan of the Dallas Cowboys, have the choice loving, or hating the new home of the Dallas Cowboys because all it is is a building being built. It is lacking that one element to make this image fit the title, and make it even more special than it is. Never give up, try again.', '2008-06-09 18:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
