(4760256, 686325, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wonderful tones and lighting on this ''cowboy'' portrait. Great focus and wonderfully sharp details! It REALLY projects the sense of the ol''west. And I have to say the pose and look of your model REALLY channels Clint Eastwood from The Good, The Bad, &amp; The Ugly. The sepia tones give it a look and feel of a classic western movie. This ain''t no six-shooter this has a 9 fired on it:-) Great job!</td>', 'Wonderful tones and lighting on this ''cowboy'' portrait. Great focus and wonderfully sharp details! It REALLY projects the sense of the ol''west. And I have to say the pose and look of your model REALLY channels Clint Eastwood from The Good, The Bad, & The Ugly. The sepia tones give it a look and feel of a classic western movie. This ain''t no six-shooter this has a 9 fired on it:-) Great job!', '2008-06-09 20:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
