(4760728, 685066, 74979, '<td valign="top">the best of them<br/> <br/>very well done<br/>love the use of silhouette to convey the "end of the day" (homage) <br/>and the feel of respect between the horse and its rider, and back...</td>', 'the best of them very well donelove the use of silhouette to convey the "end of the day" (homage) and the feel of respect between the horse and its rider, and back...', '2008-06-09 23:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
