(4760927, 686398, 89774, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT! Such emotion without even seeing the face. I think this is a wonderful tribute.</td>', 'LOVE IT! Such emotion without even seeing the face. I think this is a wonderful tribute.', '2008-06-10 02:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
