(4761059, 686901, 59029, '<td valign="top">Nice tribute shot to Sean, more sky above would enhance similarity to the original. Also would''ve had model button his shirt.</td>', 'Nice tribute shot to Sean, more sky above would enhance similarity to the original. Also would''ve had model button his shirt.', '2008-06-10 07:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761068, 685066, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice border, and a great tribute.  Pity the sky is blown, but it''s not too distracting.</td>', 'Nice border, and a great tribute.  Pity the sky is blown, but it''s not too distracting.', '2008-06-10 07:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761070, 686657, 39430, '<td valign="top">A little blurry from too much noise reduction?  Nice balance (and off-balance) in the composition.</td>', 'A little blurry from too much noise reduction?  Nice balance (and off-balance) in the composition.', '2008-06-10 07:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761074, 687022, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is a little dark on the subject.  Some fill-light on the left would help.</td>', 'This is a little dark on the subject.  Some fill-light on the left would help.', '2008-06-10 07:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761078, 686885, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great colours, and the shooting star is very cool.  Sharpening lines are a bit too strong.</td>', 'Great colours, and the shooting star is very cool.  Sharpening lines are a bit too strong.', '2008-06-10 07:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761080, 687030, 39430, '<td valign="top">It''s a little complicated for me to work out what this is, but I got it now.  :)</td>', 'It''s a little complicated for me to work out what this is, but I got it now.  :)', '2008-06-10 07:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761081, 686696, 39430, '<td valign="top">The overall balance of the landscape is good, but the subject is very small in the frame.</td>', 'The overall balance of the landscape is good, but the subject is very small in the frame.', '2008-06-10 07:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761082, 686995, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great character, and nice use of BW.</td>', 'Great character, and nice use of BW.', '2008-06-10 07:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761083, 686268, 39430, '<td valign="top">Clever SP.  Wow, that really distorts the perspective!</td>', 'Clever SP.  Wow, that really distorts the perspective!', '2008-06-10 07:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761110, 686617, 74388, '<td valign="top">WOW, beautifully done!!</td>', 'WOW, beautifully done!!', '2008-06-10 08:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761111, 686916, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good use of DOF.  A little darkening around the edges would help focus the user without losing background detail.</td>', 'Nice lighting and good use of DOF.  A little darkening around the edges would help focus the user without losing background detail.', '2008-06-10 08:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761114, 686835, 39430, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a little cheesy setup, but the colours are nice.  I would choose a closer crop for an even green border to the subject.</td>', 'Well, it''s a little cheesy setup, but the colours are nice.  I would choose a closer crop for an even green border to the subject.', '2008-06-10 08:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761115, 686309, 39430, '<td valign="top">The sepia is a little overpowering here.  I would also choose a wider crop to show more of the scene.  As it is, the rope is lost outside the image.</td>', 'The sepia is a little overpowering here.  I would also choose a wider crop to show more of the scene.  As it is, the rope is lost outside the image.', '2008-06-10 08:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761119, 686752, 39430, '<td valign="top">My apologies if this is an SP, but this looks like a mad crazy cowboy who''s gonna start accusing me of something to pick a fight.  "Hey you, you seen my horse?  You stole my horse didn''t you?  C''mon man, give it back.  Now!  Hey, are you DEAF.  I said give it BACK!  Don''t you walk away from me, DAMMIT."  Something about the eyes.  He''s scary.  :)  Quite a good shot technically, but wow, he gives me the creeps.</td>', 'My apologies if this is an SP, but this looks like a mad crazy cowboy who''s gonna start accusing me of something to pick a fight.  "Hey you, you seen my horse?  You stole my horse didn''t you?  C''mon man, give it back.  Now!  Hey, are you DEAF.  I said give it BACK!  Don''t you walk away from me, DAMMIT."  Something about the eyes.  He''s scary.  :)  Quite a good shot technically, but wow, he gives me the creeps.', '2008-06-10 08:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761125, 686476, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, but it''s a brave move to put the cute photos in front of the DPC voters.  :)  A little dodging and USM would help this image pop.</td>', 'Nice portrait, but it''s a brave move to put the cute photos in front of the DPC voters.  :)  A little dodging and USM would help this image pop.', '2008-06-10 08:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761126, 687029, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very dark for me.  Some more light might help stop this dark hat from blending into the background.</td>', 'Very dark for me.  Some more light might help stop this dark hat from blending into the background.', '2008-06-10 08:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761128, 686697, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a little more of the horse.  He''s a little creepy with just his nose in there.  :)</td>', 'I''d like to see a little more of the horse.  He''s a little creepy with just his nose in there.  :)', '2008-06-10 08:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
