(4761142, 686937, 39430, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  The sepia colour is a little strong for me.  Maybe I''d prefer a colour shot?  or maybe more desat?</td>', 'Very nice composition.  The sepia colour is a little strong for me.  Maybe I''d prefer a colour shot?  or maybe more desat?', '2008-06-10 08:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
