(4761148, 685774, 39430, '<td valign="top">Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t see a cowboy here.  I see a fairy princess in a flowing silk gown, holding out a sugar cube, and the horse lifts it''s head and there''s a silver horn on it.  :)  But the sentiment is good, and you''ve achieved your effect well.  Beautifully dreamy.</td>', 'Maybe it''s just me, but I don''t see a cowboy here.  I see a fairy princess in a flowing silk gown, holding out a sugar cube, and the horse lifts it''s head and there''s a silver horn on it.  :)  But the sentiment is good, and you''ve achieved your effect well.  Beautifully dreamy.', '2008-06-10 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761149, 686804, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hee haw, I love these shots.  Nice use of HDR.  The position of the hand is unfortunately blocking the horse.</td>', 'Hee haw, I love these shots.  Nice use of HDR.  The position of the hand is unfortunately blocking the horse.', '2008-06-10 08:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761152, 687026, 39430, '<td valign="top">Soft-focus and bland BW means this is not a beautiful technically perfect photo to sit and enjoy.  However, I like the negative space, the spanish title, and the ''loch-ness'' quality of the photo - it makes the cow seem like an elusive legend that you were priveledged to capture.  :)</td>', 'Soft-focus and bland BW means this is not a beautiful technically perfect photo to sit and enjoy.  However, I like the negative space, the spanish title, and the ''loch-ness'' quality of the photo - it makes the cow seem like an elusive legend that you were priveledged to capture.  :)', '2008-06-10 08:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761155, 686551, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nikon?  I don''t know why, but some photos just jump out and say Nikon to me.  :)  A great character you have captured here.</td>', 'Nikon?  I don''t know why, but some photos just jump out and say Nikon to me.  :)  A great character you have captured here.', '2008-06-10 08:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
