(4761611, 687007, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ummm....wouldn''t that be a cowGIRL?  :-P  I like the colortone chosen for this.  Works well.</td>', 'Ummm....wouldn''t that be a cowGIRL?  :-P  I like the colortone chosen for this.  Works well.', '2008-06-10 15:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761613, 686852, 30049, '<td valign="top">You''re missing a tin of chew!  :-)  In all seriousness...it''s an "ok" photo.  Technically it''s done well but I think the composition is over the top with too many items.  I''d lose the flowers, gloves, and twine (should be rope anyway).  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck!</td>', 'You''re missing a tin of chew!  :-)  In all seriousness...it''s an "ok" photo.  Technically it''s done well but I think the composition is over the top with too many items.  I''d lose the flowers, gloves, and twine (should be rope anyway).  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck!', '2008-06-10 15:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761614, 686802, 30049, '<td valign="top">Aiiieeee!  Another "equipment" shot.  Sorry - seems to be quite a few like this one in the challenge.  :-]  As a still life type photo it''s ok.  The white background stands out a bit too much IMO and is really showing the shadows.  The lighting (evident on the boots and hat) is a tad harsh and could be diffused some for better effect.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Aiiieeee!  Another "equipment" shot.  Sorry - seems to be quite a few like this one in the challenge.  :-]  As a still life type photo it''s ok.  The white background stands out a bit too much IMO and is really showing the shadows.  The lighting (evident on the boots and hat) is a tad harsh and could be diffused some for better effect.  All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-06-10 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761615, 686995, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred out bg.  I wish his face wasn''t soft (non-sharp).  Seems like the focal point is off just a tad.</td>', 'I like the blurred out bg.  I wish his face wasn''t soft (non-sharp).  Seems like the focal point is off just a tad.', '2008-06-10 15:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761616, 686551, 30049, '<td valign="top">Perfect title.  Nicely focused image with good DOF.  Coming back to bump and comment.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect title.  Nicely focused image with good DOF.  Coming back to bump and comment.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-06-10 15:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761617, 685066, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and natural framing.  Coming back to comment and bump.</td>', 'Nice silhouette and natural framing.  Coming back to comment and bump.', '2008-06-10 15:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4761622, 684886, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice equipment/still life type photo.   Would work well in an ad somewhere for sure.  A tad devoid of any emotion (static).  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s a nice equipment/still life type photo.   Would work well in an ad somewhere for sure.  A tad devoid of any emotion (static).  Good luck.', '2008-06-10 15:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
