(4762337, 686832, 67237, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and processing. It might be a manual hdr. Not sure if it is tonemapped, but I like it.</td>', 'Nice composition and processing. It might be a manual hdr. Not sure if it is tonemapped, but I like it.', '2008-06-10 23:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
