(4764953, 686842, 51747, '<td valign="top">It''s a great shot. I''m taking a point off because of the questionable reference of a Cowboy.</td>', 'It''s a great shot. I''m taking a point off because of the questionable reference of a Cowboy.', '2008-06-11 21:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
