(4768305, 686842, 62187, '<td valign="top">Hmmm? You''re photo is probably going to smoke the heck out of mine. It''s certainly a better photo by all means but if not for the title, I think it would be a far cry to see it as a ''Cowboy'' shot. For me, the challenge was not only about ''Cowboy'' but also a ''Memoriam'' for a fellow photographer. Yeah, I know, ''Cause I''m wanted - Dead or Alive''. Maybe your idea was ''In Memoriam? He actually did have a challenge depicting a Motorcycle as seen here but I wonder how many voters will actually bother to see for themselves?<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=454268" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/618/120/454268.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/618/120/454268.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/618/120/454268.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Well, thanks for your time. I''m not voting in this challenge but if I were: As a challenge shot I''d have to score it a 7 or 8. Maybe a 9 ''cause it''s a wicked bad-ass photo. As a stand-alone photo: it''s a 10 all the way. Thanks for your time...</td>', 'Hmmm? You''re photo is probably going to smoke the heck out of mine. It''s certainly a better photo by all means but if not for the title, I think it would be a far cry to see it as a ''Cowboy'' shot. For me, the challenge was not only about ''Cowboy'' but also a ''Memoriam'' for a fellow photographer. Yeah, I know, ''Cause I''m wanted - Dead or Alive''. Maybe your idea was ''In Memoriam? He actually did have a challenge depicting a Motorcycle as seen here but I wonder how many voters will actually bother to see for themselves?   Well, thanks for your time. I''m not voting in this challenge but if I were: As a challenge shot I''d have to score it a 7 or 8. Maybe a 9 ''cause it''s a wicked bad-ass photo. As a stand-alone photo: it''s a 10 all the way. Thanks for your time...', '2008-06-14 07:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
