(4769413, 686900, 90387, '<td valign="top">GREAT conversion, and I love the silver tones in the sky.  What makes this stand out from similar photos are the small details like the lighting and clarity on the coiled rope.  Awesome!  Done voting.  Came back to bump this up.</td>', 'GREAT conversion, and I love the silver tones in the sky.  What makes this stand out from similar photos are the small details like the lighting and clarity on the coiled rope.  Awesome!  Done voting.  Came back to bump this up.', '2008-06-15 08:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769414, 686937, 90387, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for clouds, and leaving these in really gives a feeling of vastness to the scene.  I like the tones as well.  One of my favorites so far. Coming back to bump this up a notch.  Hope to see this on the front page!</td>', 'I''m a sucker for clouds, and leaving these in really gives a feeling of vastness to the scene.  I like the tones as well.  One of my favorites so far. Coming back to bump this up a notch.  Hope to see this on the front page!', '2008-06-15 08:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769416, 685473, 90387, '<td valign="top">What a great face!  Very nice job on the conversion, and while I wouldn''t have thought to try it, the crop works out very well! I''m being super nit picky, but I think I would have liked a full black border.</td>', 'What a great face!  Very nice job on the conversion, and while I wouldn''t have thought to try it, the crop works out very well! I''m being super nit picky, but I think I would have liked a full black border.', '2008-06-15 09:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769417, 687033, 90387, '<td valign="top">You certainly picked an excellent vantage point for this shot.  Those clouds are pretty awesome.  I''m sure it was intended, but I think the overall softness in the processing takes something away.</td>', 'You certainly picked an excellent vantage point for this shot.  Those clouds are pretty awesome.  I''m sure it was intended, but I think the overall softness in the processing takes something away.', '2008-06-15 09:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769462, 686726, 66494, '<td valign="top">Nice feel to this shot. You''ve captured that young man attitude well.</td>', 'Nice feel to this shot. You''ve captured that young man attitude well.', '2008-06-15 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769465, 686324, 66494, '<td valign="top">Like the tones, and pose, and lighting in this piece. You''ve got a whole lot of texture and detail in this low key shot. 8</td>', 'Like the tones, and pose, and lighting in this piece. You''ve got a whole lot of texture and detail in this low key shot. 8', '2008-06-15 11:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769490, 686901, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent cowboy shot and a good emulation of Sean''s shot.</td>', 'Excellent cowboy shot and a good emulation of Sean''s shot.', '2008-06-15 11:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769495, 685841, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice tribute to Sean.  Good composition and lighting.</td>', 'Nice tribute to Sean.  Good composition and lighting.', '2008-06-15 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769500, 686014, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good title and idea but clipped on the left and right, too small, out of focus, distracting elements around the boots, and the flash gives harsh lights and shadows.</td>', 'Good title and idea but clipped on the left and right, too small, out of focus, distracting elements around the boots, and the flash gives harsh lights and shadows.', '2008-06-15 11:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769505, 686805, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is this one of those silver covered guys that act like a statue in crowds for money?  Cowboy hat but other than that not very cowboy like.  The leaves above are distracting but they help fill in the frame and give more environment orientation.  Nice pose.</td>', 'Is this one of those silver covered guys that act like a statue in crowds for money?  Cowboy hat but other than that not very cowboy like.  The leaves above are distracting but they help fill in the frame and give more environment orientation.  Nice pose.', '2008-06-15 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769508, 686551, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  Good DOF, focus and pose.  I''m not a fan of cigarette shots, but it works well here with the cowboy.  9</td>', 'Excellent shot.  Good DOF, focus and pose.  I''m not a fan of cigarette shots, but it works well here with the cowboy.  9', '2008-06-15 11:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769510, 686696, 76335, '<td valign="top">What''s up with the blurry patches on the hill? Nice view and perspective -- looks like you were up high.</td>', 'What''s up with the blurry patches on the hill? Nice view and perspective -- looks like you were up high.', '2008-06-15 11:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769511, 686401, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great image -- a stretch making it meet the challenge.</td>', 'Great image -- a stretch making it meet the challenge.', '2008-06-15 11:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769513, 685990, 76430, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of potential here.  You were in a great place to get a good cowboy shot.  I just think you could have gotten a much better scene where you could see the faces and the poles weren''t so much in the way.</td>', 'There is a lot of potential here.  You were in a great place to get a good cowboy shot.  I just think you could have gotten a much better scene where you could see the faces and the poles weren''t so much in the way.', '2008-06-15 11:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769514, 686678, 76335, '<td valign="top">A bit underexposed and a stretch for the challenge.</td>', 'A bit underexposed and a stretch for the challenge.', '2008-06-15 11:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769516, 686756, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little dark -- I didn''t see the hat at first.</td>', 'A little dark -- I didn''t see the hat at first.', '2008-06-15 11:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769517, 686896, 76430, '<td valign="top">Cowboy related without the cowboy.  Good scene.  I''d like to see both of the horses together and without the barb wire fence being so prominent.</td>', 'Cowboy related without the cowboy.  Good scene.  I''d like to see both of the horses together and without the barb wire fence being so prominent.', '2008-06-15 11:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769518, 686907, 76335, '<td valign="top">Creative take on the challenge.</td>', 'Creative take on the challenge.', '2008-06-15 11:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769525, 686268, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Would like to have seen the hat in crisper detail.</td>', 'Great idea. Would like to have seen the hat in crisper detail.', '2008-06-15 11:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769526, 686856, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is this a statue?  Nice perspective.  A little more at the bottom would make it feel less clipped.</td>', 'Is this a statue?  Nice perspective.  A little more at the bottom would make it feel less clipped.', '2008-06-15 11:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769528, 685990, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good candid -- would like to have seen some faces.</td>', 'A good candid -- would like to have seen some faces.', '2008-06-15 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769529, 686900, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed with excellent exposure in difficult conditions and good rays coming off the sun.</td>', 'Nicely composed with excellent exposure in difficult conditions and good rays coming off the sun.', '2008-06-15 11:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769532, 686779, 76335, '<td valign="top">Lighting''s a bit harsh. Shot earlier or later in the day or when overcast might have helped.</td>', 'Lighting''s a bit harsh. Shot earlier or later in the day or when overcast might have helped.', '2008-06-15 11:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769533, 686964, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I''d like to see him looking at the camera.</td>', 'Great idea.  I''d like to see him looking at the camera.', '2008-06-15 11:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769536, 685066, 76430, '<td valign="top">Great shot nicely composed.  I love how the inside of the barn/stable makes such a nice frame.  One little nit-pick is that I''d like to see less negative space frame to get more detail on the subject.  Maybe a bit overexposed on the background.  Underexposing in camera or PP wouldn''t really hurt the silhouetted subject.</td>', 'Great shot nicely composed.  I love how the inside of the barn/stable makes such a nice frame.  One little nit-pick is that I''d like to see less negative space frame to get more detail on the subject.  Maybe a bit overexposed on the background.  Underexposing in camera or PP wouldn''t really hurt the silhouetted subject.', '2008-06-15 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769537, 686171, 76430, '<td valign="top">There is a mysterious story here.  Why is he holding a revolver?  What is the dust?  Where is he?  I suspect this was shot at a wild west reenactment of some sort and this is just part of the scene.</td>', 'There is a mysterious story here.  Why is he holding a revolver?  What is the dust?  Where is he?  I suspect this was shot at a wild west reenactment of some sort and this is just part of the scene.', '2008-06-15 11:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769538, 686401, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice catch.  Coyotes are difficult to catch not running away from you.  Good framing and DOF.  Maybe a bit of a stretch for the challenge but good selection if you didn''t have any cowboys or saddles.</td>', 'Nice catch.  Coyotes are difficult to catch not running away from you.  Good framing and DOF.  Maybe a bit of a stretch for the challenge but good selection if you didn''t have any cowboys or saddles.', '2008-06-15 11:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769539, 686309, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good close up showing key elements of a cowboy doing some work or preparing for rodeo riding.</td>', 'Good close up showing key elements of a cowboy doing some work or preparing for rodeo riding.', '2008-06-15 11:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769540, 686752, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good cowboy portrait.  A little too shiny on the skin due to lighting.</td>', 'Good cowboy portrait.  A little too shiny on the skin due to lighting.', '2008-06-15 11:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769542, 686779, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good catch.  Some distracting elements behind.  A little fill flash or reflector would help with the shadows.</td>', 'Good catch.  Some distracting elements behind.  A little fill flash or reflector would help with the shadows.', '2008-06-15 11:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769544, 687021, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good tribute shot.  I''m trying to figure out the details.  Is this supposed to be a spirit in a campfire (which would explain the sharp white sparks and soft focus and colored cowboy)?  It looks like the cowboy had the sun behind him.  I''m wondering how you achieved the lighting.  You did a good job.</td>', 'Good tribute shot.  I''m trying to figure out the details.  Is this supposed to be a spirit in a campfire (which would explain the sharp white sparks and soft focus and colored cowboy)?  It looks like the cowboy had the sun behind him.  I''m wondering how you achieved the lighting.  You did a good job.', '2008-06-15 12:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769583, 686709, 63503, '<td valign="top">That is a weird looking harmonica....and I am not sure that qualifies for a ''cowboy hat''....hmmmm?...great picture though.</td>', 'That is a weird looking harmonica....and I am not sure that qualifies for a ''cowboy hat''....hmmmm?...great picture though.', '2008-06-15 12:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769586, 685066, 63503, '<td valign="top">Talk about framing a shot!! beautifully composed and exposed image...and the colors you picked for the duotone and frame accent are just perfect.<br/> <br/>Edited for grammar<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-06-16 00:49:10.</i></td>', 'Talk about framing a shot!! beautifully composed and exposed image...and the colors you picked for the duotone and frame accent are just perfect. Edited for grammar', '2008-06-15 12:26:40.000000', '2008-06-16 01:49:10.000000', 1),
(4769589, 686325, 63503, '<td valign="top">I really like this one, it reminds me of one of the Clint Eastwood''s movie posters of the 1960''s. The noise in the background does not bother me, but I am sure it will be an issue for some. Perhaps a horizontal crop may have made it look even more like a movie frame.</td>', 'I really like this one, it reminds me of one of the Clint Eastwood''s movie posters of the 1960''s. The noise in the background does not bother me, but I am sure it will be an issue for some. Perhaps a horizontal crop may have made it look even more like a movie frame.', '2008-06-15 12:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769590, 686398, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and lighting. Great dof approach. Larus?</td>', 'Beautiful composition and lighting. Great dof approach. Larus?', '2008-06-15 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769591, 686937, 63503, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image, great color and great lens !!! no glare at all despite a full blown shot of the sun.</td>', 'Gorgeous image, great color and great lens !!! no glare at all despite a full blown shot of the sun.', '2008-06-15 12:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769592, 686211, 76430, '<td valign="top">Funny and nice composition without gratuitous sex.  You should have brushed them in preparation for the shot.  :-p.</td>', 'Funny and nice composition without gratuitous sex.  You should have brushed them in preparation for the shot.  :-p.', '2008-06-15 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769595, 685841, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great idea, unfortunately the tear does not appear realistic, mainly because it is tapering in the wrong direction. Also, I thing it would have looked better in duotone.</td>', 'Great idea, unfortunately the tear does not appear realistic, mainly because it is tapering in the wrong direction. Also, I thing it would have looked better in duotone.', '2008-06-15 12:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769597, 686324, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2008-06-15 12:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769599, 686908, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and exposed in a split second shot situation.  I just wish the main subject would have stood out more from the background, but that''s hard to do.  Good orientation to the location with the sign.  Maybe some selective brightening in PP, but it may look unnatural that way.</td>', 'Very nicely composed and exposed in a split second shot situation.  I just wish the main subject would have stood out more from the background, but that''s hard to do.  Good orientation to the location with the sign.  Maybe some selective brightening in PP, but it may look unnatural that way.', '2008-06-15 12:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769601, 686832, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  Excellent texture and composition.  Very fitting tribute.  10</td>', 'I love this shot.  Excellent texture and composition.  Very fitting tribute.  10', '2008-06-15 12:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769605, 686877, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of dappled light, and, duotone fits the picture perfectly. I probably would have tried to burn the blown-out areas of the tree in the left a bit more. Great image.</td>', 'Beautiful use of dappled light, and, duotone fits the picture perfectly. I probably would have tried to burn the blown-out areas of the tree in the left a bit more. Great image.', '2008-06-15 12:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769608, 686710, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2008-06-15 12:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769609, 686551, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very genuine looking. Good soft light overall. Even the smoke looks great. This would have been a great ''Senior Marlboro Man'' poster...:-)</td>', 'Very genuine looking. Good soft light overall. Even the smoke looks great. This would have been a great ''Senior Marlboro Man'' poster...:-)', '2008-06-15 12:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769612, 686885, 63503, '<td valign="top">I like the image but find it a bit oversharpened, and the colors are too intense for my taste. You must have waited a long time for the jet plane to show up !!!</td>', 'I like the image but find it a bit oversharpened, and the colors are too intense for my taste. You must have waited a long time for the jet plane to show up !!!', '2008-06-15 12:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769613, 686523, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great image.</td>', 'Great image.', '2008-06-15 12:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769617, 686898, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful action shot. I personally don''t like the exagareted use of noise ninja (neat image?) as it essentailly ruins every texture in the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful action shot. I personally don''t like the exagareted use of noise ninja (neat image?) as it essentailly ruins every texture in the picture.', '2008-06-15 13:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769618, 686804, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!! it reminds me of a Pedro picture.</td>', 'Nice shot!! it reminds me of a Pedro picture.', '2008-06-15 13:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769622, 684886, 63503, '<td valign="top">It would be ''Vaya'' ......nice image though.</td>', 'It would be ''Vaya'' ......nice image though.', '2008-06-15 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769627, 686832, 63503, '<td valign="top">Of the 3 pictures in the challenge of similar concept, this is the one I like the best. Great dynamic range, great processing.</td>', 'Of the 3 pictures in the challenge of similar concept, this is the one I like the best. Great dynamic range, great processing.', '2008-06-15 13:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769635, 686774, 63503, '<td valign="top">This is a superb portrait...welcome to DPC Rembrandt, I predict you''ll win all of the portrait challenges.</td>', 'This is a superb portrait...welcome to DPC Rembrandt, I predict you''ll win all of the portrait challenges.', '2008-06-15 13:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769660, 687007, 91150, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t fit the challenge. It''s a girl so technically it''s a cow*girl*. Good picture anyways.</td>', 'This doesn''t fit the challenge. It''s a girl so technically it''s a cow*girl*. Good picture anyways.', '2008-06-15 13:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769774, 685066, 94226, '<td valign="top">Very tasteful and fitting for the tribute.<br/> <br/>I''m going to add that this is my favourite. There were a couple that did a good job of emulating Sean''s work, but this one is original as well as, to me, the most poignant and touching.<br/> <br/>Sorry I could only give you a 10, and hope you win.</td>', 'Very tasteful and fitting for the tribute. I''m going to add that this is my favourite. There were a couple that did a good job of emulating Sean''s work, but this one is original as well as, to me, the most poignant and touching. Sorry I could only give you a 10, and hope you win.', '2008-06-15 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769975, 685841, 54446, '<td valign="top">I think this is just right for this challenge.  My favorite in this challenge.  (10)</td>', 'I think this is just right for this challenge.  My favorite in this challenge.  (10)', '2008-06-15 19:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769978, 686774, 54446, '<td valign="top">Striking portrait.  Hope this ribbons!  (9)</td>', 'Striking portrait.  Hope this ribbons!  (9)', '2008-06-15 19:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4769980, 687007, 94226, '<td valign="top">I''m editing my comment as I made a joke and since I don''t know who you are it may have been inappropriate. If you read it and were offended in anyway I sincerely apologise.</td>', 'I''m editing my comment as I made a joke and since I don''t know who you are it may have been inappropriate. If you read it and were offended in anyway I sincerely apologise.', '2008-06-15 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770025, 686916, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the boy.  However the hat is the only thing connecting him to the cowboy.  The shirt, bike and background do not help meet the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot of the boy.  However the hat is the only thing connecting him to the cowboy.  The shirt, bike and background do not help meet the challenge.', '2008-06-15 20:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770027, 686769, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I wish she was wearing a cowboy hat.  A little blown out on her back.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I wish she was wearing a cowboy hat.  A little blown out on her back.', '2008-06-15 20:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770028, 686877, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and processing.  I would like it better if he wasn''t facing out of the picture, but the eyes going inwards really helps resolve that a lot.</td>', 'Nice shot and processing.  I would like it better if he wasn''t facing out of the picture, but the eyes going inwards really helps resolve that a lot.', '2008-06-15 20:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770031, 686835, 76430, '<td valign="top">Now this is a different Woody shot.  Interesting that it looks like a huge version of his hat, and maybe it is.  Nice colors and lighting.</td>', 'Now this is a different Woody shot.  Interesting that it looks like a huge version of his hat, and maybe it is.  Nice colors and lighting.', '2008-06-15 20:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770033, 686812, 76430, '<td valign="top">I really like how the background supports the title and foreground subject.  Is the horizon tilted or is it on a hill?</td>', 'I really like how the background supports the title and foreground subject.  Is the horizon tilted or is it on a hill?', '2008-06-15 20:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770037, 686919, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus and bright colors very suitable for the small horse.  Good composition.  Maybe a little bit too bright.</td>', 'Nice soft focus and bright colors very suitable for the small horse.  Good composition.  Maybe a little bit too bright.', '2008-06-15 20:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770039, 686804, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like how the ultra-wide angle shot emphasizes the hand and nose.  Good interest from the white horse also.</td>', 'I like how the ultra-wide angle shot emphasizes the hand and nose.  Good interest from the white horse also.', '2008-06-15 20:32:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4770040, 686398, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice moody lighting suits the challenge description well.</td>', 'Nice moody lighting suits the challenge description well.', '2008-06-15 20:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770046, 686680, 76430, '<td valign="top">Dutch cowboy stories?  Nice take on the subject in a place where cowboys are hard to come by.  I don''t like the corner of the book cover clipped.  What is the yellow?  it distracts from the picture.</td>', 'Dutch cowboy stories?  Nice take on the subject in a place where cowboys are hard to come by.  I don''t like the corner of the book cover clipped.  What is the yellow?  it distracts from the picture.', '2008-06-15 20:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770047, 687007, 76430, '<td valign="top">Even girls can be cowboys.  Good pose.  Those look like some thick glasses!</td>', 'Even girls can be cowboys.  Good pose.  Those look like some thick glasses!', '2008-06-15 20:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770049, 686617, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent take on the theme of the challenge.  The best tribute to JawnyRico I''ve seen yet.  Excellent exposure.  10</td>', 'Excellent take on the theme of the challenge.  The best tribute to JawnyRico I''ve seen yet.  Excellent exposure.  10', '2008-06-15 20:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770050, 687000, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the face sharper.</td>', 'I''d like to see the face sharper.', '2008-06-15 20:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770051, 686574, 76430, '<td valign="top">This looks overly sharpened.  Also maybe cropping closer in on the stirrup and leg would be better.</td>', 'This looks overly sharpened.  Also maybe cropping closer in on the stirrup and leg would be better.', '2008-06-15 20:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770052, 686996, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good tribute.  Nicely composed and lit.</td>', 'Good tribute.  Nicely composed and lit.', '2008-06-15 20:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770053, 686324, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting here.  Good pose also.  It may be the lighting but it seems a bit soft on the face.</td>', 'I like the lighting here.  Good pose also.  It may be the lighting but it seems a bit soft on the face.', '2008-06-15 20:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770054, 686151, 76430, '<td valign="top">OK, not your typical cowboy shot.  I guess this will work.  Nice view of the sky, but if the subject is the stadium I''d recommend getting much closer if possible.</td>', 'OK, not your typical cowboy shot.  I guess this will work.  Nice view of the sky, but if the subject is the stadium I''d recommend getting much closer if possible.', '2008-06-15 20:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770055, 686857, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good timing and fitting title.  In sepia the horse blends into the fence too much.</td>', 'Good timing and fitting title.  In sepia the horse blends into the fence too much.', '2008-06-15 20:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770059, 686898, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice timing on the shot.  The horse''s eye looks like it''s fearful.  Good background.</td>', 'Nice timing on the shot.  The horse''s eye looks like it''s fearful.  Good background.', '2008-06-15 20:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4770060, 686792, 76430, '<td valign="top">Common theme here.  I like the lighting and color.  I''d like to see the face.  Not much other than the hat linking the person to a cowboy.  What is that, red bricks on the pickup truck?</td>', 'Common theme here.  I like the lighting and color.  I''d like to see the face.  Not much other than the hat linking the person to a cowboy.  What is that, red bricks on the pickup truck?', '2008-06-15 20:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
