(4770773, 687021, 20608, '<td valign="top">nice tribute Adam</td>', 'nice tribute Adam', '2008-06-16 06:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770780, 685066, 47852, '<td valign="top">So happy to see that this one took the blue.  It jumped out at me during voting and really caught my eye in a way that very few photos do.  And if you hadn''t noticed yet, not only is it a fantastic score, but it''s enough to get you on the page of top rated photos of all time!  Quite an accomplishment!  Congrats! :)</td>', 'So happy to see that this one took the blue.  It jumped out at me during voting and really caught my eye in a way that very few photos do.  And if you hadn''t noticed yet, not only is it a fantastic score, but it''s enough to get you on the page of top rated photos of all time!  Quite an accomplishment!  Congrats! :)', '2008-06-16 06:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770795, 686922, 83686, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo and a fitting tribute to his memory for you and now us at DPC. I am glad that you shared a bit of who he was outside of what we knew here from his photography. This photo is really good, I scored it at 7. I liked the image of the farm with the child and adult looking at the horses, it brings back memories of my youth as a lover of horses. Please continue in your photography with us here.</td>', 'This is a good photo and a fitting tribute to his memory for you and now us at DPC. I am glad that you shared a bit of who he was outside of what we knew here from his photography. This photo is really good, I scored it at 7. I liked the image of the farm with the child and adult looking at the horses, it brings back memories of my youth as a lover of horses. Please continue in your photography with us here.', '2008-06-16 07:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
