(4770810, 686617, 42615, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by catnapper:</b></div><hr/><i> .... My point is that we live in a diverse society and that we need to know about the beliefs and lifestyles of others before using symbols that may risk offending. Your photo is well thought out and your sentiments are genuine... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I feel this was the BEST sentiment shared.  Sorry catnapper but I think EVERYONE should be able to represent their beliefs, lifestyles and use of symbols without fear of offending.  Congratulations senor_kasper....I knew I''d see this on the front page!!</td>', 'Originally posted by catnapper: .... My point is that we live in a diverse society and that we need to know about the beliefs and lifestyles of others before using symbols that may risk offending. Your photo is well thought out and your sentiments are genuine...   I feel this was the BEST sentiment shared.  Sorry catnapper but I think EVERYONE should be able to represent their beliefs, lifestyles and use of symbols without fear of offending.  Congratulations senor_kasper....I knew I''d see this on the front page!!', '2008-06-16 08:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
