(4770875, 686574, 66384, '<td valign="top">I think I might have liked this better without the extreme processing. I like the composition and the the way you have focused on the legs of the horse and rider. The detail of the stirrup and boot are nice, and I love the contour of the horse''s muscles.</td>', 'I think I might have liked this better without the extreme processing. I like the composition and the the way you have focused on the legs of the horse and rider. The detail of the stirrup and boot are nice, and I love the contour of the horse''s muscles.', '2008-06-16 09:38:34.000000', NULL, 0),
