(4770881, 687021, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oooh I thought this would have scored higher.  I planned on coming back after the challenge to see how you did this.  This has a cool Indiana Jones vibe.  A very nice tribute indeed and a very cool picture.</td>', 'Oooh I thought this would have scored higher.  I planned on coming back after the challenge to see how you did this.  This has a cool Indiana Jones vibe.  A very nice tribute indeed and a very cool picture.', '2008-06-16 09:45:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770889, 685066, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is Melissa: Wow! This is an amazing picture. I loved this one a lot. I love the tone and the border. It was beautifully done. Sean would have loved this one. Believe me, I have spent many many hours sitting in front of this computer screen judging and voting on shots with him. He taught me a lot and I learned which ones he would pick. And this is certainly one of them. Thank you so much for participating in this tribute to my Wonderful Husband, Sean. He would have been so happy!! And I just sent you my address. I would love to put this picture up in my own tribute to him. Thank you so much!!</td>', 'This is Melissa: Wow! This is an amazing picture. I loved this one a lot. I love the tone and the border. It was beautifully done. Sean would have loved this one. Believe me, I have spent many many hours sitting in front of this computer screen judging and voting on shots with him. He taught me a lot and I learned which ones he would pick. And this is certainly one of them. Thank you so much for participating in this tribute to my Wonderful Husband, Sean. He would have been so happy!! And I just sent you my address. I would love to put this picture up in my own tribute to him. Thank you so much!!', '2008-06-16 09:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770891, 686909, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this image, and the back lighting gives it a nice emotive touch. The two things I would like to see a bit different are the exposure and the sepia tone. It is a little too dark and a little too orange, at least on my monitor. The sun rays in the background are very nice. I wonder if there is a way to emphasize them a little more.</td>', 'I like the composition of this image, and the back lighting gives it a nice emotive touch. The two things I would like to see a bit different are the exposure and the sepia tone. It is a little too dark and a little too orange, at least on my monitor. The sun rays in the background are very nice. I wonder if there is a way to emphasize them a little more.', '2008-06-16 09:57:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770892, 686617, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is Melissa: Thank you so much for participating in this challenge to honor my Wonderful Husband, Sean. I appreciate that you are thinking of our feelings and that means a lot. I am not offended in any way, for it was your tribute to Sean. I thought the silouette was a beautiful idea, since that was his winning shot. Also the hat and the camera, shows things he truly loved. I love the colors, it is absolutely breathtaking. He would have loved the fact that you took the time to wait for the perfect sky. He always did that too. I know he would have loved this shot. Thank you so much for your thoughts &amp; this picture.</td>', 'This is Melissa: Thank you so much for participating in this challenge to honor my Wonderful Husband, Sean. I appreciate that you are thinking of our feelings and that means a lot. I am not offended in any way, for it was your tribute to Sean. I thought the silouette was a beautiful idea, since that was his winning shot. Also the hat and the camera, shows things he truly loved. I love the colors, it is absolutely breathtaking. He would have loved the fact that you took the time to wait for the perfect sky. He always did that too. I know he would have loved this shot. Thank you so much for your thoughts & this picture.', '2008-06-16 10:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770894, 686885, 66348, '<td valign="top">This is Melissa: Thank you so much for participating in this challenge. It really means a lot that you would take the time to enter and capture what Sean loved. I love this picture too, the coloring and the (jet/star). It does remind me of his. Again, thank you so much!!</td>', 'This is Melissa: Thank you so much for participating in this challenge. It really means a lot that you would take the time to enter and capture what Sean loved. I love this picture too, the coloring and the (jet/star). It does remind me of his. Again, thank you so much!!', '2008-06-16 10:01:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770895, 686937, 63269, '<td valign="top">I noticed a few people commented on the blown out sun. I personally think it''s <i>perfect</i>. ;) Without the pure white of the sun, the tones would only range from black to light brown. You need some touches of pure white or else the image doesn''t have enough contrast. Also, having the white sun at the top of the image gives an atmosphere of bright daylight. It feels like high noon, perfect for the cowboy theme. Cropping out that sun, I think, would make this image loose a great deal of it''s impact. Just my personal thoughts. :) In any case this is a very beautiful image!</td>', 'I noticed a few people commented on the blown out sun. I personally think it''s perfect. ;) Without the pure white of the sun, the tones would only range from black to light brown. You need some touches of pure white or else the image doesn''t have enough contrast. Also, having the white sun at the top of the image gives an atmosphere of bright daylight. It feels like high noon, perfect for the cowboy theme. Cropping out that sun, I think, would make this image loose a great deal of it''s impact. Just my personal thoughts. :) In any case this is a very beautiful image!', '2008-06-16 10:04:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770898, 686802, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great minds, think alike. (You know what I mean.) I like your composition and the red makes a very nice still life. I''m not crazy about the white wall. Since this was advanced editing, I might have added a little color there to tone it down. My other thought on this, as a challenge entry, is that it might be a little too cheerful for a memorial image.</td>', 'Great minds, think alike. (You know what I mean.) I like your composition and the red makes a very nice still life. I''m not crazy about the white wall. Since this was advanced editing, I might have added a little color there to tone it down. My other thought on this, as a challenge entry, is that it might be a little too cheerful for a memorial image.', '2008-06-16 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770911, 686267, 66384, '<td valign="top">My first impression of this was: nice, clear, good detail, but it seems busy, and something is off. As I try to figure out what that something is, I am leaning toward the angle. I think it might have been more effective if you had gotten the camera lower and slightly to the left, had more of that rugged tree as background and less of the green ground cover. I think the lower point of view would have added a bit more depth and definition to the shot.</td>', 'My first impression of this was: nice, clear, good detail, but it seems busy, and something is off. As I try to figure out what that something is, I am leaning toward the angle. I think it might have been more effective if you had gotten the camera lower and slightly to the left, had more of that rugged tree as background and less of the green ground cover. I think the lower point of view would have added a bit more depth and definition to the shot.', '2008-06-16 10:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4770924, 686328, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast, the hat, shirt, and bolo tie. I think the image would have been much more effective without the tiny boots, which are very distracting.</td>', 'I like the contrast, the hat, shirt, and bolo tie. I think the image would have been much more effective without the tiny boots, which are very distracting.', '2008-06-16 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 0),
