(4770964, 686774, 63503, '<td valign="top">I thought this would ribbon. Personally I love the fact that you can make out the hat in your imagination (without even thinking about it) prompted only by the lower outline and the ribbon around it, so, the fact that the rest of it blends with the background is an added feature, the way I see it. <br/> <br/>This excellent portrait is another example of the amazing diversification process we are witnessing of Irene.<br/> <br/>Rembrandt (obviously) did not have studio lights at his disposal, only windows; so did Irene for this picture.<br/></td>', 'I thought this would ribbon. Personally I love the fact that you can make out the hat in your imagination (without even thinking about it) prompted only by the lower outline and the ribbon around it, so, the fact that the rest of it blends with the background is an added feature, the way I see it.  This excellent portrait is another example of the amazing diversification process we are witnessing of Irene. Rembrandt (obviously) did not have studio lights at his disposal, only windows; so did Irene for this picture.', '2008-06-16 10:54:31.000000', NULL, 0),
