(4771492, 686832, 67145, '<td valign="top">when i opened dpc this morning and saw the cowboy challenge on my home page, well i thought you might be on the front page .. dont know why !! .. so i opened it up .. <br/>8th place aint bad .. !!<br/>brilliant image .. love the fact that he''s not even there, just the hat .. <br/>a wonderful photograph, an excellent process, love your imaginative approach, and congrats on your excellent finish in the challenge .. :)</td>', 'when i opened dpc this morning and saw the cowboy challenge on my home page, well i thought you might be on the front page .. dont know why !! .. so i opened it up .. 8th place aint bad .. !!brilliant image .. love the fact that he''s not even there, just the hat .. a wonderful photograph, an excellent process, love your imaginative approach, and congrats on your excellent finish in the challenge .. :)', '2008-06-16 17:08:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4771509, 686996, 63812, '<td valign="top">I think this image transmits with intensity a deep feeling of respect. I hoped to see it in the first page. Anyway congratulations. This is an excellent photography</td>', 'I think this image transmits with intensity a deep feeling of respect. I hoped to see it in the first page. Anyway congratulations. This is an excellent photography', '2008-06-16 17:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
