(4771779, 685066, 29011, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the blue with the very fine capture :)<br/>Excellent shot all around, great framing and also like the IR look of the greenery in the background. Great job with the toning.</td>', 'Congratulations on the blue with the very fine capture :)Excellent shot all around, great framing and also like the IR look of the greenery in the background. Great job with the toning.', '2008-06-16 20:52:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4771787, 686885, 77393, '<td valign="top">An outstanding image.  Congrats on the ribbon.  Well deserved.</td>', 'An outstanding image.  Congrats on the ribbon.  Well deserved.', '2008-06-16 21:03:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4771814, 685066, 86447, '<td valign="top">Thanks, Techo!  That means a lot to me because, for the year 2008, (if I''m reading the list correctly) there is only one image with a higher score than this and that is YOURS! <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=642962" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/812/120/642962.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/812/120/642962.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/812/120/642962.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I think folks were being very generous with their scores since it was a tribute challenge.  I didn''t realize this was a really good score until <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=47852" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">kteach</a> had me looking at the high scoring photos.<br/> <br/>Regardless, I appreciate the high votes and the really friendly and encouraging comments (AND the ones that aren''t!).  This place is WONDERFUL!   Even when my score is low, folks have encouraging AND helpful things to say to help me grow.<br/> <br/>I hope I can add back even a portion of what I''ve gotten from this site''s commenters.<br/> <br/>Thanks bunches!  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks, Techo!  That means a lot to me because, for the year 2008, (if I''m reading the list correctly) there is only one image with a higher score than this and that is YOURS!   I think folks were being very generous with their scores since it was a tribute challenge.  I didn''t realize this was a really good score until  kteach had me looking at the high scoring photos. Regardless, I appreciate the high votes and the really friendly and encouraging comments (AND the ones that aren''t!).  This place is WONDERFUL!   Even when my score is low, folks have encouraging AND helpful things to say to help me grow. I hope I can add back even a portion of what I''ve gotten from this site''s commenters. Thanks bunches!  :) ', '2008-06-16 21:18:44.000000', NULL, 0),
