(4772701, 686792, 30861, '<td valign="top">Love the processing here, beautiful image. You were right about it being a little off-topic. If it were just a *normal* cowboy challenge I bet it would have done better, but since this was a memorial thing tastes ran more to the overtly emotional, even clichéd, approach.<br/> <br/>Excellent work regardless, I like it very much.</td>', 'Love the processing here, beautiful image. You were right about it being a little off-topic. If it were just a *normal* cowboy challenge I bet it would have done better, but since this was a memorial thing tastes ran more to the overtly emotional, even clichéd, approach. Excellent work regardless, I like it very much.', '2008-06-17 12:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
