(4772977, 686996, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not the most "wow" shot in the challenge, but certainly one of the most heartfelt, and that part transmits very, very well.  A lovely photograph and tribute.  Brings with it a deep sadness and respect.</td>', 'Perhaps not the most "wow" shot in the challenge, but certainly one of the most heartfelt, and that part transmits very, very well.  A lovely photograph and tribute.  Brings with it a deep sadness and respect.', '2008-06-17 15:55:59.000000', NULL, 0),
