(4773640, 686842, 60862, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Oh, well, on the score.  DNMC, of course.  But if you''ve got something similar, put it in the free study.  I bet it''d do very well!</td>', 'Great shot!  Oh, well, on the score.  DNMC, of course.  But if you''ve got something similar, put it in the free study.  I bet it''d do very well!', '2008-06-18 00:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4773991, 685066, 23430, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot. Congrats on the top spot.</td>', 'Awesome shot. Congrats on the top spot.', '2008-06-18 04:33:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(4773995, 686710, 23430, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. I like the composition and the light on the horse and darkened background. Well done.</td>', 'Good action shot. I like the composition and the light on the horse and darkened background. Well done.', '2008-06-18 04:36:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4774290, 685066, 649, '<td valign="top">Congrats Lydia.<br/> <br/>Lee</td>', 'Congrats Lydia. Lee', '2008-06-18 09:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4774396, 685066, 91150, '<td valign="top">WOW! Congrats! =D</td>', 'WOW! Congrats! =D', '2008-06-18 10:32:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4774518, 686454, 44877, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting and excellent photo! I had a similar idea, but my boots, though worn a lot, still look pretty spiffy. That would not have been as effective as what you created. Good finish, too.</td>', 'Superb lighting and excellent photo! I had a similar idea, but my boots, though worn a lot, still look pretty spiffy. That would not have been as effective as what you created. Good finish, too.', '2008-06-18 11:33:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4774672, 686697, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful photo, generously encompassing the theme of the challenge.  All subtlety and very deep - something I''d expect to see in my favourite gallery, though not, alas(?), on the dpc front page.</td>', 'This is a wonderful photo, generously encompassing the theme of the challenge.  All subtlety and very deep - something I''d expect to see in my favourite gallery, though not, alas(?), on the dpc front page.', '2008-06-18 13:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775126, 686857, 68035, '<td valign="top">Barbara, Well in what was - perhaps for obvious reasons - quite a maudlin challenge, this was a breathe of fresh air.  A great spur of the moment capture which is genuine humourous (all the more so because it is not ''posed'').  I like the sepia treatment and the great sharpness.  I really cant believe that anyone would be so mean as to score this a one, because even in times of sorry it is great to laugh</td>', 'Barbara, Well in what was - perhaps for obvious reasons - quite a maudlin challenge, this was a breathe of fresh air.  A great spur of the moment capture which is genuine humourous (all the more so because it is not ''posed'').  I like the sepia treatment and the great sharpness.  I really cant believe that anyone would be so mean as to score this a one, because even in times of sorry it is great to laugh', '2008-06-18 17:41:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775156, 686909, 68035, '<td valign="top">I felt that the best shots in this challenge were the ones which avoided too much bathos and this is one of them.  To ne honest I had not seen the light as anything spiritual but I thought the picture evoked peace and tranquility which one hopes awaits us all.  I will be honest and say I did not like the title but I did like the image and its way better that way round than the other<br/> <br/>Nice tribute</td>', 'I felt that the best shots in this challenge were the ones which avoided too much bathos and this is one of them.  To ne honest I had not seen the light as anything spiritual but I thought the picture evoked peace and tranquility which one hopes awaits us all.  I will be honest and say I did not like the title but I did like the image and its way better that way round than the other Nice tribute', '2008-06-18 18:00:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775404, 686780, 48228, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective for this challenge. My only suggestion would be to maybe not have the sky in the image, but I still like this one as it is.....</td>', 'Simple and effective for this challenge. My only suggestion would be to maybe not have the sky in the image, but I still like this one as it is.....', '2008-06-18 21:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4775731, 685066, 1030, '<td valign="top">A well deserved blue ribbon. Congrads!</td>', 'A well deserved blue ribbon. Congrads!', '2008-06-19 02:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776348, 686937, 39427, '<td valign="top">Hey Art, Congrats on the top 20 this is a really beautiful photograph</td>', 'Hey Art, Congrats on the top 20 this is a really beautiful photograph', '2008-06-19 12:47:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776695, 685066, 49954, '<td valign="top">Lovely image.  Was hoping a silhouette would win!</td>', 'Lovely image.  Was hoping a silhouette would win!', '2008-06-19 18:42:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776866, 685066, 94295, '<td valign="top">Hi, I''m Sean''s sister in law, Michelle. I just wanted to tell you that your picture was my favorite from the very beginning and i so appreciate your post and tribute to Sean. He would have chose this photo too in my opinion. The response on this website to our loss has been so beautiful, i don''t even have words to describe it. Thank you so much for thinking of my sister, Melissa, it means the world to me. Thanks again,  Michelle</td>', 'Hi, I''m Sean''s sister in law, Michelle. I just wanted to tell you that your picture was my favorite from the very beginning and i so appreciate your post and tribute to Sean. He would have chose this photo too in my opinion. The response on this website to our loss has been so beautiful, i don''t even have words to describe it. Thank you so much for thinking of my sister, Melissa, it means the world to me. Thanks again,  Michelle', '2008-06-19 21:58:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776886, 685066, 86447, '<td valign="top">Thank you, Michelle. Your kindness in registering to tell us this has made my day.  I''m so glad that you feel blessed by our tributes.  There are many on this site who worked hard to show respect and honor to Sean.   I''m really pleased that it''s meant something to you and your family.  We are blessed in return.  :)</td>', 'Thank you, Michelle. Your kindness in registering to tell us this has made my day.  I''m so glad that you feel blessed by our tributes.  There are many on this site who worked hard to show respect and honor to Sean.   I''m really pleased that it''s meant something to you and your family.  We are blessed in return.  :)', '2008-06-19 22:30:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4776958, 686014, 86447, '<td valign="top">Please don''t be discouraged by your first entry.  It takes a while to get to know what folks like here.   <br/> <br/>Your vision of the boots as a good subject was spot on!   It just needs a bit of tweaking of the technique... and before you know it, you''ll be scoring with the ''high rollers'' here.   *grin*<br/> <br/>Pay attention to a recurring theme in the comments and work on those things one item at a time until you conquer that (ignore the odd ones!  *grin* ).  Compete with yourself on your score.   Can you score just a tad bit higher next entry?   Then a bit higher the next?   It''s all about learning, you know.<br/> <br/>I''m looking forward to seeing how you progress.  Enter again!   :)</td>', 'Please don''t be discouraged by your first entry.  It takes a while to get to know what folks like here.    Your vision of the boots as a good subject was spot on!   It just needs a bit of tweaking of the technique... and before you know it, you''ll be scoring with the ''high rollers'' here.   *grin* Pay attention to a recurring theme in the comments and work on those things one item at a time until you conquer that (ignore the odd ones!  *grin* ).  Compete with yourself on your score.   Can you score just a tad bit higher next entry?   Then a bit higher the next?   It''s all about learning, you know. I''m looking forward to seeing how you progress.  Enter again!   :)', '2008-06-19 23:06:46.000000', NULL, 0),
