(4896169, 685066, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is such a wonderful tribute to Sean.  I know he would have loved it - I know I do.  This really spoke to me during the challenge as being an image that he would not only create, but identify with.  Superbly executed and expertly presented.  There''s wonderful emotion and style shown here.  Congratulations on your well-deserved blue ribbon and for sharing this gem with us.</td>', 'This is such a wonderful tribute to Sean.  I know he would have loved it - I know I do.  This really spoke to me during the challenge as being an image that he would not only create, but identify with.  Superbly executed and expertly presented.  There''s wonderful emotion and style shown here.  Congratulations on your well-deserved blue ribbon and for sharing this gem with us.', '2008-08-18 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 0),
