(4907710, 686780, 49804, '<td valign="top">This shot has a lot of potential, it looks like the lighting was a little dull which in turn made the colors a little dull. Maybe try this one in black and white and do some dodging on the hat to really make it stand out, nonetheless a great tribute and a nice shot. Sorry comments took so long, hope they are helpful.</td>', 'This shot has a lot of potential, it looks like the lighting was a little dull which in turn made the colors a little dull. Maybe try this one in black and white and do some dodging on the hat to really make it stand out, nonetheless a great tribute and a nice shot. Sorry comments took so long, hope they are helpful.', '2008-08-24 13:38:44.000000', NULL, 0),
