(5038015, 686617, 63398, '<td valign="top">Sean Mahoney''s The Last Goodbye is one of the most awesome, evocative images I have ever experienced. I''m touched to see that his image still inspires people after all this time. You''ve done a wonderful tribute here......I don''t know why I missed it before. A truly masterful work, sir!</td>', 'Sean Mahoney''s The Last Goodbye is one of the most awesome, evocative images I have ever experienced. I''m touched to see that his image still inspires people after all this time. You''ve done a wonderful tribute here......I don''t know why I missed it before. A truly masterful work, sir!', '2008-11-02 06:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
