(5225676, 686617, 30807, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones, and I particularly like the camera hanging from the cross - like the cowboy photographer has shot his last, (at least in mortality) and the horse is paying his respects to the man - really good shot with a touch of lightness even in a serious shot<br/> <br/>keep taking those special pictures!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-01-29 05:25:02.</i></td>', 'Beautiful tones, and I particularly like the camera hanging from the cross - like the cowboy photographer has shot his last, (at least in mortality) and the horse is paying his respects to the man - really good shot with a touch of lightness even in a serious shot keep taking those special pictures!', '2009-01-29 05:21:21.000000', '2009-01-29 05:25:02.000000', 0),
